  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together soy sauce, sesame oil, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add the diced onions, carrots, and celery to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "Spread the mixture on a baking sheet and roast for 20 minutes.",
    "In a separate pan, heat a couple of tablespoons of sesame oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the cubed tofu to the pan and cook until golden brown.",
    "Add the cooked brown rice to the pan and stir to combine with the tofu.",
    "Stir in the roasted mirepoix mixture and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the fresh or dried lime leaves to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Serve the mixture in a bowl and garnish with additional lime leaves if desired."
  ],
